               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-STATUS-CODE-0057.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RESOLVE-TAX-BAND-0058.
